# Design system

The current design (sumi-e: ink and water, washi paper, one vermilion accent, the system font, light mode by default) is documented in `.claude/brain/design-system.md`. Taste, scope and writing rules are in `.claude/brain/playbook.md`. Follow those.

The earlier "Meniscus" design (glass over deep water, Newsreader and IBM Plex, dark first, one route per chapter) is retired. Its text is archived in `.claude/brain/archive/meniscus-design-system-2026-06.md` for reference only.
